asr-000258
00:25:27.200 --> 00:25:31.840
DOLE Presenter: Employment Program and the Child Labour Prevention and Elimination Program.

asr-000259
00:25:31.840 --> 00:25:37.200
DOLE Presenter: Honourable Chair, we would like to manifest our concern regarding the proposed allocation,

asr-000260
00:25:37.200 --> 00:25:42.100
DOLE Presenter: specifically the decrease in the budget for the TUPAD Program under the National Expenditure

asr-000261
00:25:42.100 --> 00:25:43.100
DOLE Presenter: Program.

asr-000262
00:25:43.100 --> 00:25:44.940
DOLE Presenter: TUPAD is a vital lifeline for our vulnerable communities.

asr-000263
00:25:44.940 --> 00:25:50.660
DOLE Presenter: With the unpredictable nature of calamities, frequent emergency situations, and challenge

asr-000264
00:25:50.660 --> 00:25:56.160
