00:46:45.860 --> 00:46:48.860
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Rep JP Bagernos

asr-000531
00:46:48.860 --> 00:46:51.860
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Rep Coco Yap

asr-000532
00:46:51.860 --> 00:46:52.860
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Vice Chair Bernadette Barber

asr-000533
00:46:52.860 --> 00:46:53.860
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Vice Chair Cristina Nyong'o

asr-000534
00:46:53.860 --> 00:46:54.860
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Vice Chair Cristina Nyong'o

asr-000535
00:46:54.900 --> 00:47:05.700
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Sina Talavera-Lopez, Rep. Leo Rodriguez, Vice Chair Romeo Momo, Sr., Vice Chair Jerry Boy Espina, Jr.,

asr-000536
00:47:05.700 --> 00:47:13.700
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Vice Chair Baba Yap, Representative Ori Tariella, and Vice Chair Rufus Rodriguez.

asr-000537
00:47:21.990 --> 00:47:24.450
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: As always, Vice Chair Rufus, always a pleasure.

asr-000538
00:47:25.450 --> 00:47:28.630
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Buhay na buhay ang ating committee hearings pag nandito po siya.

asr-000539
00:47:28.630 --> 00:47:34.710
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: So, with that said, we go straight right away to the interpolations and discussions.

asr-000540
00:47:35.650 --> 00:47:43.370
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: And may I remind our distinguished colleagues that each member is allotted five minutes for questions or interpolation.

asr-000541
00:47:44.330 --> 00:47:52.930
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Excluding the responses of the resource persons, when the bell sounds, the member has 30 seconds to conclude.

asr-000542
00:47:53.590 --> 00:47:58.230
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Consistent with the longstanding practice of the House of the Chair, we shall recognize the minority.

asr-000543
00:47:58.630 --> 00:48:04.490
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Independent, and the majority members in an alternating manner, when practicable.

asr-000544
00:48:05.190 --> 00:48:11.510
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: The Chair first recognizes the Honorable Elijah San Fernando from the minority.

asr-000545
00:48:12.510 --> 00:48:13.250
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: You have the floor, sir.

asr-000546
00:48:13.530 --> 00:48:14.310
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-000547
00:48:14.430 --> 00:48:17.570
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Firstly, we would like to convey our support for the budget of TESDA.

asr-000548
00:48:18.530 --> 00:48:21.530
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Isa po sa mga well-performing po na mga ahensya ng gobyerno.

asr-000549
00:48:29.000 --> 00:48:29.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: For TESDA.

asr-000550
00:48:32.250 --> 00:48:32.870
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That's another.

asr-000551
00:48:32.890 --> 00:48:33.390
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That's another topic.

asr-000552
00:48:34.830 --> 00:48:41.390
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, noong August 13, naglabas ng order ang Pasig RTC Branch 152, stating,

asr-000553
00:48:42.070 --> 00:48:48.870
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: let a writ of preliminary injunction be issued upon posting a bond of 10 billion pesos.

asr-000554
00:48:49.510 --> 00:48:53.770
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: As party to the case, nakapaglagak na po ba ang mga petitioner ng bond?

asr-000555
00:48:53.890 --> 00:48:55.950
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: This is answerable by yes or no, Mr. Chair.

asr-000556
00:48:57.210 --> 00:48:58.470
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I'm not aware. Therefore, it's no.

asr-000557
00:48:59.190 --> 00:49:00.830
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, hindi po nakapaglagak.

asr-000558
00:49:00.830 --> 00:49:01.930
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I'm not aware of this.

asr-000559
00:49:02.890 --> 00:49:06.390
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: You're not aware po, Mr. Secretary, but DOLE is party to the case.

asr-000560
00:49:06.410 --> 00:49:11.570
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That's why we filed a motion for immediate resolution last September 3, Your Honor.

asr-000561
00:49:12.930 --> 00:49:14.450
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary, tama po yan.

asr-000562
00:49:14.510 --> 00:49:21.630
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: In fact, the petitioners themselves admitted na hindi nila kayang makapaglagak ng 10 billion pesos bond.

asr-000563
00:49:22.490 --> 00:49:32.210
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sabi ng OSG, in the absence of a writ, walang pumipigil sa DOLE na ipatupad ang dagdag sahod.

asr-000564
00:49:32.210 --> 00:49:39.450
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kahapon, sabi po ng Judiciary sa budget hearing, kapag walang bond, walang injunction.

asr-000565
00:49:40.230 --> 00:49:43.990
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Therefore, in effect, ang Wage Order No. 27.

asr-000566
00:49:44.170 --> 00:49:49.670
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: The question is, what is the position of DOLE sa usapin ng pagpapatupad ng Wage Order?

asr-000567
00:49:49.670 --> 00:50:00.050
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Your Honor, members of this committee, the Office of the Solicitor General stands as the legal counsel of the Department of Labor and Employment.

asr-000568
00:50:00.630 --> 00:50:01.970
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Therefore, we are in unison.

asr-000569
00:50:02.210 --> 00:50:06.030
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: With the legal position of the Office of the Solicitor General.

asr-000570
00:50:06.910 --> 00:50:18.530
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The Supreme Court announcement yesterday, perhaps I saw a clip in the reels, was reflective of Rule 59 of the Rules of Court,

asr-000571
00:50:18.530 --> 00:50:23.430
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: which I totally agree, sans a posting of a bond.

asr-000572
00:50:24.350 --> 00:50:27.770
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The writ is not in order, Your Honor.

asr-000573
00:50:28.150 --> 00:50:31.550
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: If that is the case, Secretary, bakit hindi po ipatupad?

asr-000574
00:50:32.210 --> 00:50:35.530
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng Department of Labor and Employment yung Wage Order No. 27.

asr-000575
00:50:36.270 --> 00:50:37.690
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ikaw po mismo ang nagsasabi.

asr-000576
00:50:38.430 --> 00:50:42.710
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Na kinikilala nyo ang posisyon ng gobyerno, no bond, no injunction.

asr-000577
00:50:42.710 --> 00:50:51.870
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Therefore, yung dagdag sahod ng mga minimum wage earner ay dapat ipatupad at ibigay na since July 25.

asr-000578
00:50:52.470 --> 00:50:53.910
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000579
00:50:55.710 --> 00:51:00.010
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Mr. Chairman, Your Honor, members of this committee,

asr-000580
00:51:02.210 --> 00:51:04.230
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Department of Labor,

asr-000581
00:51:04.230 --> 00:51:20.410
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ang kagawaran po ng empleyo ay naniniwala na ang paglilift ng injunction is not a matter of self-help.

asr-000582
00:51:21.630 --> 00:51:27.990
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Naniniwala po tayo sa mga inilabas na desisyon ng Korte Suprema.

asr-000583
00:51:28.350 --> 00:51:32.190
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kabilang na po ang LCK versus Pagbilao Development Corporation,

asr-000584
00:51:32.210 --> 00:51:41.370
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: G.R. 195374, 19 March 2014, which I quote:

asr-000585
00:51:44.380 --> 00:51:47.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The Supreme Court questioned us,

asr-000586
00:51:47.940 --> 00:51:51.160
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I mean us, not just the executive branch,

asr-000587
00:51:51.880 --> 00:51:56.540
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: against treating a bond defect, including the non-filing thereof,

asr-000588
00:51:57.000 --> 00:52:03.120
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: not as an automatic license to disregard injunctive relief.

asr-000591
00:52:05.980 --> 00:52:12.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Failure to fix a bond or post a bond did not itself justify quashing the injunction.

asr-000592
00:52:13.760 --> 00:52:21.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: And, Your Honor, there is another case, Development Bank of the Philippines versus Carpio, GR 147-191,

asr-000593
00:52:22.960 --> 00:52:33.340
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: where the Supreme Court mentioned that there is no such thing as a doctrine of unilateral disregard.

asr-000594
00:52:33.340 --> 00:52:35.800
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang ibig pong sabihin, Your Honor,

asr-000595
00:52:35.980 --> 00:52:40.800
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: If there is a facial court restraint which is outstanding,

asr-000596
00:52:41.580 --> 00:52:48.580
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: the affected party should obtain a judicial declaration of that consequence

asr-000597
00:52:48.580 --> 00:52:53.900
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: rather than conclusively deciding the matter for itself.

asr-000598
00:52:54.500 --> 00:52:59.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang ibig pong sabihin, Mr. Chairman, Your Honors, with all due respect,

asr-000599
00:53:00.060 --> 00:53:05.360
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po ang dole, hindi po ang litigants.

asr-000600
00:53:05.980 --> 00:53:09.960
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang magdi-desisyon kung mali ang proseso.

asr-000601
00:53:10.660 --> 00:53:13.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang magdi-desisyon po nito ay ang husgado.

asr-000602
00:53:14.760 --> 00:53:21.900
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Sila po lang ang may puder, courts, have the discretion over the bond and the integrity of a bond,

asr-000603
00:53:21.900 --> 00:53:27.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: and that does not automatically void any previous injunction,

asr-000604
00:53:27.500 --> 00:53:31.760
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: and the objecting party must challenge it, and the court must correct it.

asr-000605
00:53:32.180 --> 00:53:35.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That's why, Your Honor, we filed this, September 3,

asr-000606
00:53:35.980 --> 00:53:41.660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ang abugado po namin ay Office of the Solicitor General, motion to resolve.

asr-000607
00:53:42.080 --> 00:53:42.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yes, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000608
00:53:42.820 --> 00:53:43.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I-resolve na nila.

asr-000609
00:53:44.120 --> 00:53:49.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Sa ngayon, kung ano po yung inyong nararamdaman, yun din po yung aming nararamdaman.

asr-000610
00:53:50.080 --> 00:53:55.880
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: But, again, I raise this principle, and members of the bar here present would agree with me,

asr-000611
00:53:57.140 --> 00:54:04.040
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: that the doctrine of self-help is applicable in a very narrow or limited situations.

asr-000612
00:54:04.040 --> 00:54:05.320
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: For instance,

asr-000613
00:54:05.980 --> 00:54:11.140
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: nung katadaan lang pong habagat, Your Honor, marami nakikinig ngayon,

asr-000614
00:54:11.720 --> 00:54:17.080
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: applicable po yung doktrina sa Civil Code of the Philippines, Article 429,

asr-000615
00:54:17.600 --> 00:54:21.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na kung mababa yung lugar mo, yung kapitbahay mo yung mas mataas,

asr-000616
00:54:21.640 --> 00:54:28.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: pwede mong ilipat yung gamit doon sa mataas ng lugar na kahit walang court order, yung po yung self-help.

asr-000617
00:54:29.320 --> 00:54:32.960
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Sa criminal case, meron po tayo sa rules of court.

asr-000618
00:54:32.960 --> 00:54:35.120
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: If a crime is being committed,

asr-000619
00:54:35.980 --> 00:54:37.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: one's presence, you can arrest.

asr-000620
00:54:38.340 --> 00:54:39.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That's a citizen's arrest.

asr-000621
00:54:39.600 --> 00:54:41.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That's a doctrine of self-help.

asr-000622
00:54:42.100 --> 00:54:43.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Konti-konti lang po yan.

asr-000623
00:54:43.400 --> 00:54:49.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit, Your Honor, there is no comparable doctrine, general doctrine,

asr-000624
00:54:49.740 --> 00:54:53.880
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: authorizing a litigant or a government agency, including the DOLE,

asr-000625
00:54:54.420 --> 00:54:58.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: to substitute its own judgment for that of a court,

asr-000626
00:54:58.820 --> 00:55:04.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: and unilaterally treat a judicial injunction as nonexistent,

asr-000627
00:55:04.820 --> 00:55:08.540
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: merely because it believes, as I believe,

asr-000628
00:55:08.980 --> 00:55:14.040
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: that the bond requirement has not been satisfied.

asr-000629
00:55:14.540 --> 00:55:15.180
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair,

asr-000630
00:55:15.540 --> 00:55:16.600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung po yung...

asr-000631
00:55:16.600 --> 00:55:16.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair,

asr-000632
00:55:17.180 --> 00:55:18.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair,

asr-000633
00:55:20.880 --> 00:55:22.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pasimplihan lang po natin, Sekretary.

asr-000634
00:55:23.880 --> 00:55:25.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Walang bond, walang injunction.

asr-000635
00:55:26.800 --> 00:55:28.920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Therefore, the wage order is in effect.

asr-000636
00:55:29.540 --> 00:55:30.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Tama ba, Mr. Sekretary?

asr-000637
00:55:30.640 --> 00:55:31.280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ganito po yun.

asr-000638
00:55:31.920 --> 00:55:33.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes or no po.

asr-000639
00:55:33.140 --> 00:55:34.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: There is no bond.

asr-000640
00:55:35.060 --> 00:55:35.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Therefore,

asr-000641
00:55:35.380 --> 00:55:36.980
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: therefore, there is no injunction.

asr-000642
00:55:37.600 --> 00:55:39.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: There is no bond.

asr-000643
00:55:39.380 --> 00:55:39.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: There is no writ.

asr-000644
00:55:41.220 --> 00:55:43.560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ibig sabihin, the wage order is in effect.

asr-000645
00:55:44.060 --> 00:55:46.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: There is an injunction insofar as the writ is concerned.

asr-000646
00:55:46.740 --> 00:55:48.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: There is no writ.

asr-000647
00:55:48.960 --> 00:55:49.660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Paliwanag ko po.

asr-000648
00:55:49.680 --> 00:55:50.040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi po.

asr-000649
00:55:50.140 --> 00:55:51.140
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kung papayagan niyo po ako.

asr-000650
00:55:51.220 --> 00:55:51.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Magkaiba po yung injunction.

asr-000651
00:55:51.940 --> 00:55:57.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, malinaw po ang nakasulat sa order ni RTC Branch 152,

asr-000652
00:55:57.080 --> 00:55:59.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pasig Judge Mary Joyce Manungsong.

asr-000653
00:55:59.900 --> 00:56:04.900
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Let a preliminary injunction be issued upon...

asr-000654
00:56:05.380 --> 00:56:07.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Posting a bond of 10 billion pesos.

asr-000655
00:56:08.020 --> 00:56:08.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: There is no bond.

asr-000656
00:56:09.640 --> 00:56:10.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pwede po akong magsalita?

asr-000657
00:56:11.000 --> 00:56:11.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes po.

asr-000658
00:56:11.780 --> 00:56:12.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ganito po yun.

asr-000659
00:56:13.380 --> 00:56:17.280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kung atin pong bubusisiin yung kasaysayan nito,

asr-000660
00:56:17.900 --> 00:56:21.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: nagsimula po ito sa status ko ante order.

asr-000661
00:56:22.440 --> 00:56:27.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That was issued by the executive branch judge of Pasig RTC.

asr-000662
00:56:27.460 --> 00:56:32.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That was July 24, a day before the implementation.

asr-000663
00:56:33.540 --> 00:56:34.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pakatapos po nun,

asr-000664
00:56:34.440 --> 00:56:37.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: sumunod yung Temporary Restraining Order.

asr-000665
00:56:37.940 --> 00:56:41.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang kasunod po nun, kasi maglalapse yung Temporary Restraining Order,

asr-000666
00:56:41.940 --> 00:56:45.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ito na nga pong writ of preliminary injunction.

asr-000667
00:56:45.940 --> 00:56:50.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So there would be two documents visually in front of me right now.

asr-000668
00:56:50.440 --> 00:56:57.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The order of injunction as well as the writ which requires, as a condition precedent,

asr-000669
00:56:57.940 --> 00:57:00.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: the payment of the 10 billion bond.

asr-000670
00:57:00.940 --> 00:57:02.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Without the bond,

asr-000671
00:57:02.940 --> 00:57:03.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: without the bond,

asr-000672
00:57:03.940 --> 00:57:05.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: the writ falls.

asr-000673
00:57:05.440 --> 00:57:07.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: But facially,

asr-000674
00:57:07.440 --> 00:57:11.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: starting from the status quo order,

asr-000675
00:57:11.440 --> 00:57:13.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Temporary Restraining Order,

asr-000676
00:57:13.440 --> 00:57:15.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: the injunction order,

asr-000677
00:57:15.440 --> 00:57:21.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: you have a facially substantial order coming from the court,

asr-000678
00:57:21.440 --> 00:57:27.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: which the court has the sole right to lift, correct, or dissolve.

asr-000679
00:57:27.440 --> 00:57:29.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: That's why we filed a motion to resolve.

asr-000680
00:57:29.440 --> 00:57:30.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po,

asr-000681
00:57:30.440 --> 00:57:31.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: mawalanggalang na po,

asr-000682
00:57:31.440 --> 00:57:32.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung napataas yung buwasis ko,

asr-000683
00:57:32.440 --> 00:57:33.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po,

asr-000684
00:57:33.440 --> 00:57:38.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: hindi po ang DOLE ang magde-decide kung na-dissolve na yung bond.

asr-000685
00:57:38.940 --> 00:57:44.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Under the threat of contempt pursuant to Rule 71,

asr-000686
00:57:44.940 --> 00:57:48.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: eh hindi po karapatan namin na mag-decide.

asr-000687
00:57:48.440 --> 00:57:51.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Isimplihan ko na lang po siguro po ito.

asr-000688
00:57:51.940 --> 00:58:01.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Meron po akong halimbawa na tickets sa dalawang airline companies,

asr-000689
00:58:01.440 --> 00:58:02.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na inamin naman nila na hindi na-issued.

asr-000691
00:58:03.440 --> 00:58:09.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi naman po ako pwedeng pumunta na lang doon sa airport at dumiretso sa aeroplano.

asr-000692
00:58:09.440 --> 00:58:11.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: There is a process for this.

asr-000693
00:58:11.440 --> 00:58:14.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I should be given, recognized by the airline manager,

asr-000694
00:58:14.440 --> 00:58:16.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I should be given a boarding pass.

asr-000695
00:58:16.440 --> 00:58:23.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: In a similar manner, kung yung ating mga senior citizen ay nagkamali yung binigay na gamot ng mercury drug,

asr-000696
00:58:23.440 --> 00:58:29.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: eh hindi naman basta pwedeng pumasok si lola o yung nanay ko sa bodega ng mercury drug para kunin yung tamang gamot.

asr-000697
00:58:29.440 --> 00:58:30.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Mr. Chair,

asr-000698
00:58:30.440 --> 00:58:32.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ganon din po dito. Lalong-lalong na po ito.

asr-000699
00:58:32.440 --> 00:58:33.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000700
00:58:33.440 --> 00:58:38.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ay hukuman. Pero lahat po ng sinasabi niyo ay nararamdaman ko po iyon.

asr-000701
00:58:38.440 --> 00:58:45.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary, so in simple words, hindi ipapatupad ng Department of Labor and Employment yung dagdag ng sahot?

asr-000702
00:58:45.440 --> 00:58:50.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ipapatupad po namin. Ganito po yun. Ayun, napataas na naman yung boses ko.

asr-000703
00:58:50.440 --> 00:58:58.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kayo po yun nag-file, at sinusuportahan ko kayo, kayo po yun nag-file ng certiorary sa Supreme Court.

asr-000704
00:58:58.440 --> 00:59:01.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Para ang Regional Trial Court ay kumilos.

asr-000705
00:59:01.440 --> 00:59:04.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: I disregard yung injunction.

asr-000706
00:59:04.440 --> 00:59:09.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nagpa sa ilalim po ang mga grupo ninyo at lahat ng manggagawa.

asr-000707
00:59:09.440 --> 00:59:17.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At tayo po ay sumusuporta dyan, including current petitions for intervention na makasali kayo sa usgado.

asr-000708
00:59:17.440 --> 00:59:27.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nung nag-file po kayo ng petisyon sa Supreme Court, ang ibig sabihin po, kinikilala rin nyo rin po yung hurisdiksyon, mawalanggalang na, with all due respect,

asr-000709
00:59:27.440 --> 00:59:29.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ng hindi lang ng kataas-taas ang hukuman.

asr-000710
00:59:29.440 --> 00:59:37.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kung hindi ng Regional Trial Court tumpasig. Dahil sinasabing nyo sa Supreme Court, orderan nyo ang RTC.

asr-000711
00:59:37.440 --> 00:59:43.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Chair, ang argument nga po namin walang jurisdiksyon in the first place ang RTC.

asr-000712
00:59:43.440 --> 00:59:49.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: That is why pumunta na kami sa Supreme Court para magbigay ng kalinawan ang mataas na hukuman.

asr-000713
00:59:49.440 --> 00:59:57.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Dahil hindi namin kinikilala ang jurisdiksyon ng Regional Trial Court as already enshrined in the Labor Code, Article 126,

asr-000714
00:59:57.440 --> 00:59:59.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: now being the Secretary of Labor.

asr-000715
01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: board and employment, Mr. Secretary, Mr. Chair,

asr-000716
01:00:03.040 --> 01:00:06.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dapat nga hindi nyo kinilalay yung jurisdiction ng korte

asr-000717
01:00:06.220 --> 01:00:09.380
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: because it is very clear in Article 126.

asr-000718
01:00:10.300 --> 01:00:11.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At merong appeal process.

asr-000719
01:00:12.160 --> 01:00:16.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang appeal process kung merong aggrieved party sa Article 123,

asr-000720
01:00:16.680 --> 01:00:19.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: binabanggit sa National Wages and Productivity Commission.

asr-000721
01:00:19.760 --> 01:00:25.720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, ang binabanggit ng DOLE ngayon, pagkahaba-haba po nang ine-explain ninyo,

asr-000722
01:00:25.720 --> 01:00:31.460
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at the end of it all, sinasabi nyo, hindi nyo ipapatupad yung dagdag sahod.

asr-000723
01:00:31.480 --> 01:00:32.620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Wala po akong sinabing gano'n po.

asr-000724
01:00:32.700 --> 01:00:34.780
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: O di, ipapatupad nyo po yung dagdag sahod.

asr-000725
01:00:34.840 --> 01:00:37.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ito po ay nakasalalay sa decision of the government.

asr-000726
01:00:37.240 --> 01:00:38.080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi nga, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000727
01:00:38.080 --> 01:00:39.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ayoko po magpagtalo.

asr-000728
01:00:39.520 --> 01:00:40.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary.

asr-000729
01:00:40.140 --> 01:00:42.480
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kahit po lumabas po ito sa social media.

asr-000730
01:00:42.480 --> 01:00:46.000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes. Meron po kayong kapangyarihan, Mr. Secretary.

asr-000731
01:00:47.100 --> 01:00:49.360
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Iginawad ng kongreso yan sa inyo.

asr-000732
01:00:50.140 --> 01:00:55.140
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: RA 6727, ibinigay sa mga regional wage boards

asr-000733
01:00:55.140 --> 01:00:58.880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang exclusive power in determining wages.

asr-000734
01:00:59.980 --> 01:01:02.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ngayon sinasabi po, DOLE mismo ang nagbabanggit,

asr-000735
01:01:03.100 --> 01:01:04.740
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: parang hindi kayo makasagot.

asr-000736
01:01:04.840 --> 01:01:05.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes or no lang, kasimple.

asr-000737
01:01:06.440 --> 01:01:09.020
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ipatutupad ng DOLE, sang-ayon sa nakasulat sa batas.

asr-000738
01:01:09.440 --> 01:01:12.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Kung kakasuhan kayo, Mr. Secretary, nandyan ang OSG.

asr-000739
01:01:13.360 --> 01:01:15.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Ang inihingi po ng mga minimum wage earners at ng mga manggagawa,

asr-000740
01:01:16.640 --> 01:01:20.760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: tindigan nyo naman yung karapatan ng mga minimum wage earners.

asr-000741
01:01:20.860 --> 01:01:22.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Hindi po namin marinig sa inyo eh.

asr-000742
01:01:23.580 --> 01:01:24.840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Mr. Secretary, Mr. Chair,

asr-000743
01:01:25.140 --> 01:01:26.620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: pwede na po ako magsalita?

asr-000744
01:01:26.720 --> 01:01:27.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yes po.

asr-000745
01:01:29.640 --> 01:01:35.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Alam nyo po, Mr. Chairman, hinahangaan ko po kayo sa sinasabi nyo yan.

asr-000746
01:01:36.040 --> 01:01:40.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit, kung titignan natin yung Article 126,

asr-000747
01:01:40.860 --> 01:01:45.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: when it refers to a prohibition on injunction,

asr-000748
01:01:46.380 --> 01:01:48.360
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: it refers to a proceeding.

asr-000749
01:01:49.360 --> 01:01:52.620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kaya nga po, sa pagmamahal ko po sa inyong samahan

asr-000750
01:01:52.620 --> 01:01:54.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: at sa mga manggagawa na rin,

asr-000751
01:01:55.140 --> 01:02:00.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: tayo po ay nag-issue ng Administrative Order 264

asr-000752
01:02:00.220 --> 01:02:05.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung saan po natin niliwanag, pinaliwanag, pinalawak,

asr-000753
01:02:06.320 --> 01:02:12.660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: binigyan ng ilaw kung ano ang tamang ibig sabihin ng 126

asr-000754
01:02:12.660 --> 01:02:15.280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: through an administrative order.

asr-000755
01:02:16.040 --> 01:02:20.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At yan din po ang dahilan kung bakit yung dati kong colleague

asr-000756
01:02:20.700 --> 01:02:25.100
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: sa mataas na kapulungan, si Sen. Rafi Tulfo,

asr-000757
01:02:25.140 --> 01:02:29.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay nag-file ng amendatory bill sa Senado

asr-000758
01:02:29.460 --> 01:02:36.140
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung paano dapat maintindihan o mapalawak ang Article 126.

asr-000759
01:02:37.220 --> 01:02:39.480
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: 126 refers to proceedings.

asr-000760
01:02:40.260 --> 01:02:45.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So ang ginawa po natin sa Administrative Order No. 264

asr-000761
01:02:45.180 --> 01:02:49.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay palawakin ang ibig sabihin ng proceedings, Your Honor.

asr-000762
01:02:53.440 --> 01:02:53.860
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pwede po.

asr-000763
01:02:56.140 --> 01:02:59.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Palawakin ang ibig sabihin ng proceedings to include

asr-000764
01:02:59.620 --> 01:03:02.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: implementation, monitoring of the board,

asr-000765
01:03:04.680 --> 01:03:11.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: execution, and ensuring that wage orders are complied with.

asr-000766
01:03:12.080 --> 01:03:13.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pinalawak po natin yun.

asr-000767
01:03:13.680 --> 01:03:19.380
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yung po siguro ang isang sinyales na pinaninindigan po natin

asr-000768
01:03:19.380 --> 01:03:23.540
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kahit po nung pagpa-file natin ng motion for reconsideration

asr-000769
01:03:23.540 --> 01:03:28.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na basang-basa na po tayo ng ulan sa Lunsod ng Pasig at Bumabaha

asr-000770
01:03:28.460 --> 01:03:29.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay tinuloy po natin.

asr-000771
01:03:29.620 --> 01:03:33.740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At para sa kalaman po nga ng kagalanggalang

asr-000772
01:03:33.740 --> 01:03:39.340
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na mga kasama dito sa lupung ito,

asr-000773
01:03:39.760 --> 01:03:41.000
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: tayo po ang nag-

asr-000774
01:03:41.000 --> 01:03:44.280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung kakausapin nyo ang Office of the Solicitor General,

asr-000775
01:03:44.460 --> 01:03:47.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: tayo po ang nagsulong, nag-udyok, at naghikayat

asr-000776
01:03:47.640 --> 01:03:53.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na sila ang mag-file ng motion for early resolution.

asr-000777
01:03:53.620 --> 01:03:55.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Lahat po ng aking hakbang, Your Honors,

asr-000778
01:03:55.920 --> 01:03:58.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay nakasalalay sa batal.

asr-000779
01:03:59.620 --> 01:04:02.360
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: As bilang isang abugado,

asr-000780
01:04:03.460 --> 01:04:10.100
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: nanumpa po ako na puprotektahan ang batas,

asr-000781
01:04:10.420 --> 01:04:13.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: hindi lamang asaligang batas ng Pilipinas.

asr-000782
01:04:13.940 --> 01:04:15.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Binanggit ko po kanina

asr-000783
01:04:15.180 --> 01:04:21.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: that I do not subscribe to the doctrine of self-help.

asr-000784
01:04:21.240 --> 01:04:26.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po natin dapat hawakan sa sarili nating kamay

asr-000785
01:04:26.420 --> 01:04:28.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: anuman ang interpretasyon natin.

asr-000786
01:04:28.780 --> 01:04:33.680
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Gusto man natin o hindi na ito ang tamang ipatupad.

asr-000787
01:04:34.360 --> 01:04:41.500
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: We cannot be an arbiter of our own cause or controversies.

asr-000788
01:04:42.180 --> 01:04:44.540
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Dapat po sana maunawaan ng lupung ito

asr-000789
01:04:44.540 --> 01:04:49.000
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na ang ating ginagawa ay paggalang sa batas.

asr-000790
01:04:49.660 --> 01:04:52.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Tama po yung inyong sinasabi, naniniwala po ako,

asr-000791
01:04:52.720 --> 01:04:58.740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: tama rin po yung sinabi ng kung sino yung Supreme Court spokesperson kahapon,

asr-000792
01:04:58.780 --> 01:05:02.480
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na kung walang bond, walang writ.

asr-000793
01:05:03.620 --> 01:05:08.200
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit, ang dapat magsabi po nito ay hindi ako,

asr-000794
01:05:08.720 --> 01:05:11.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung hindi ang Supreme Court o ang husgado.

asr-000795
01:05:12.800 --> 01:05:18.080
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At naniliwala rin po ako na karapatan ng manggagawang Pilipino

asr-000796
01:05:18.080 --> 01:05:23.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: sa National Capital Region na matagal kong pinaglingkuran sa Metro Manila

asr-000797
01:05:23.260 --> 01:05:27.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na makatanggap na sila ng karapat dapat na umento

asr-000798
01:05:27.420 --> 01:05:28.660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: dahil sa taas.

asr-000799
01:05:28.660 --> 01:05:31.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Na ng presyo ng bilihin, kuryente, at iba pa.

asr-000800
01:05:32.500 --> 01:05:35.240
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: If that is your position, Mr. Chair, Mr. Sekretary,

asr-000801
01:05:35.860 --> 01:05:39.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: bakit hindi nyo po masabi na ipapatupad na ng dole?

asr-000802
01:05:39.880 --> 01:05:42.500
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Paikot-ikot lang po tayo dito, Mr. Chair, Mr. Sekretary.

asr-000803
01:05:42.600 --> 01:05:44.220
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sinasabi nyo po, galangin yung batas.

asr-000804
01:05:45.000 --> 01:05:47.580
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: E batas din naman po ang nagsasabi na kapangyarihan nyo

asr-000805
01:05:47.580 --> 01:05:50.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yung magpatupad at magtakda ng sahod.

asr-000806
01:05:51.700 --> 01:05:54.680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: So, bakit hindi po namin makuha mula sa inyo, Mr. Sekretary?

asr-000807
01:05:55.760 --> 01:05:57.520
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pasabihin nyo po yung paulit-ulit na naman,

asr-000808
01:05:57.520 --> 01:05:59.120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: paikot-ikot na naman tayo sa batas.

asr-000809
01:05:59.280 --> 01:06:01.960
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero batas din ang nagsasabi, iginawad nga sa inyo.

asr-000810
01:06:02.300 --> 01:06:03.400
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yung kapangyarihan.

asr-000811
01:06:04.360 --> 01:06:06.320
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ngayon po, pwede po akong sumagot.

asr-000812
01:06:06.980 --> 01:06:08.860
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ngayon po kasi, your honor...

asr-000813
01:06:08.860 --> 01:06:10.340
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Maandar yung oras ko, Mr. Chair.

asr-000814
01:06:11.460 --> 01:06:12.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi ko po nakita.

asr-000815
01:06:14.200 --> 01:06:16.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Dati po kasi sa Senado, hindi rin ako nakatingin dyan.

asr-000816
01:06:17.260 --> 01:06:18.960
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi ko po nakita yung oras. Sorry po.

asr-000817
01:06:19.840 --> 01:06:20.600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Uulitin ko po.

asr-000818
01:06:21.180 --> 01:06:24.760
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kung ano man po ang itinatakda ng batas,

asr-000819
01:06:24.760 --> 01:06:26.760
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ang magpapalawig,

asr-000820
01:06:27.520 --> 01:06:29.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: magpapaliwanag o magkaklarify

asr-000821
01:06:29.640 --> 01:06:33.800
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: at magtatakda kung ano ang tamang interpretasyon

asr-000822
01:06:33.800 --> 01:06:35.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay ang husgado.

asr-000823
01:06:36.280 --> 01:06:39.060
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Lalong-lalo na ang kataas-taasang hukuman

asr-000824
01:06:39.060 --> 01:06:41.160
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: at hindi po ang mga abugado.

asr-000825
01:06:42.260 --> 01:06:43.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po ang mga litigants.

asr-000826
01:06:44.700 --> 01:06:47.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Tayo po ay miyembro ng bar

asr-000827
01:06:47.820 --> 01:06:50.200
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: at kumikinikilala natin

asr-000828
01:06:50.200 --> 01:06:53.060
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ang supremacy of the law

asr-000829
01:06:53.060 --> 01:06:56.880
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: through our judicial institutions.

asr-000830
01:06:57.240 --> 01:06:57.500
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, pagkakataon,

asr-000831
01:06:57.520 --> 01:06:58.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: pag sinabi po ng husgado,

asr-000832
01:06:59.120 --> 01:07:01.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ipatupad nyo mamaya, ipapatupad na po natin mamaya.

asr-000833
01:07:02.580 --> 01:07:04.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pag sinabi po ng husgado,

asr-000834
01:07:04.140 --> 01:07:05.100
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ipatupad nyo bukas,

asr-000835
01:07:05.220 --> 01:07:06.600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ipapatupad natin bukas.

asr-000836
01:07:07.100 --> 01:07:09.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Tayo po ay nagpa-sa-ilalim sa batas

asr-000837
01:07:09.260 --> 01:07:11.200
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: sa husgado. Kagaya na rin po

asr-000838
01:07:11.200 --> 01:07:13.680
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ng ginawa nyo, nung kayo ay nag-file

asr-000839
01:07:13.680 --> 01:07:16.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ng certiorary sa Supreme Court,

asr-000840
01:07:16.160 --> 01:07:17.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kayo ay nagpa-ilalim

asr-000841
01:07:17.400 --> 01:07:19.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: sa puder ng kataas-taasang

asr-000842
01:07:19.700 --> 01:07:21.760
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: hukuman. At hinihintay nyo,

asr-000843
01:07:22.140 --> 01:07:23.080
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: hinihintay ko rin

asr-000844
01:07:23.080 --> 01:07:25.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: with bated breath

asr-000845
01:07:25.400 --> 01:07:27.120
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung ano man po ang kalalabasan

asr-000846
01:07:27.520 --> 01:07:28.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: nung sa Supreme Court.

asr-000847
01:07:29.780 --> 01:07:31.320
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Sige po. Alam nyo po,

asr-000848
01:07:31.400 --> 01:07:32.700
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: tayo kaya nating mag-antay.

asr-000849
01:07:33.060 --> 01:07:35.660
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Pero ang mga minimum wage earner na araw-araw

asr-000850
01:07:35.660 --> 01:07:37.440
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: inaagawan ng 60 pesos,

asr-000851
01:07:37.600 --> 01:07:39.620
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: maliit man sa pandinig natin, malaking bagay

asr-000852
01:07:39.620 --> 01:07:41.480
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: yan sa buhay ng mga minimum wage earner.

asr-000853
01:07:42.380 --> 01:07:43.600
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Yan po yung dahilan kung bakit

asr-000854
01:07:43.600 --> 01:07:45.640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: nagagalit tayo. Dahil naririnig

asr-000855
01:07:45.640 --> 01:07:47.280
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mismo natin sa dole, hindi nyo

asr-000856
01:07:47.280 --> 01:07:49.160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: kayang tindigan kung ano yung mandato ninyo.

asr-000857
