01:59:34.800 --> 01:59:35.960
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Can I respond now?

asr-001397
01:59:36.480 --> 01:59:37.120
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Yes.

asr-001398
01:59:37.900 --> 01:59:39.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kaya nga po, Your Honor,

asr-001399
01:59:40.700 --> 01:59:41.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: pakatapos pong

asr-001400
01:59:41.920 --> 01:59:43.500
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: lumabas yung

asr-001401
01:59:43.500 --> 01:59:46.360
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: restraining order galing sa

asr-001402
01:59:46.360 --> 01:59:48.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pasig RTC, ay atin

asr-001403
01:59:48.700 --> 01:59:49.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: pong inilabas naman

asr-001404
01:59:49.980 --> 01:59:51.740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: bilang paghahanda

asr-001405
01:59:51.740 --> 01:59:53.900
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung Administrative Order

asr-001406
01:59:53.900 --> 01:59:56.880
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: 264, which will be

asr-001407
01:59:56.880 --> 01:59:58.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: prospective

asr-001408
01:59:58.020 --> 01:59:59.300
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: in application.

asr-001409
02:00:00.000 --> 02:00:13.040
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Para nang sa ganun po ay magabayan yung ating mga regional wage boards sa mga susunod na pagkakataon na kanilang ipatutupad yung bagong wage orders.

asr-001410
02:00:13.040 --> 02:00:21.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At kabilang po dito ang nakaambana sa Region 7, sa Calabar Zone, at sa Region 3.

asr-001411
02:00:22.000 --> 02:00:27.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So yung Administrative Order 264 clarified prospectively.

asr-001412
02:00:27.940 --> 02:00:36.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: What they should do, including monitoring, execution, and implementation.

asr-001413
02:00:37.220 --> 02:00:43.760
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Naniniwala po kami that with this order ay mangangambana na po siguro yung iba namang magfafile.

asr-001414
02:00:44.320 --> 02:00:48.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pero hindi pa rin siguro natin masasawat na lahat.

asr-001415
02:00:48.640 --> 02:00:57.000
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pero dahil doon sa ating inilabas at kagaya po nung sinabi ko si Sen. Tulfo ay meron ding finile sa mataas na kapulungan,

asr-001416
02:00:57.000 --> 02:01:10.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay palagay ko po ito ay magiging sapat na balakid para hindi sila magsulong free-willingly ng mga ganoong court cases, Your Honor.

asr-001417
02:01:11.640 --> 02:01:17.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, just for the record, so pag lumabas po ang mga wage order na ito na pending sa iba't ibang regions,

asr-001418
02:01:17.540 --> 02:01:23.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: paninindigan po ba ito ng DOLE kahit na may lumabas pa na injunction from other courts in these regions?

asr-001419
02:01:24.580 --> 02:01:26.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Paninindigan po natin yan dahil klaro na po ngayon.

asr-001420
02:01:27.000 --> 02:01:34.060
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yung with Administrative Order 264, in-expand na po natin yung definition ng proceedings.

asr-001421
02:01:34.600 --> 02:01:46.000
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Sa Article 126, yung proceedings ay yung proceedings, yung pagpulong sa isang hapag ng isang wage board o ng kakomisyon ng NWPC.

asr-001422
02:01:46.860 --> 02:01:49.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So balit dito ay maliwanag na kung ano yung mga gagawin.

asr-001423
02:01:49.720 --> 02:01:53.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So sa paninindigan, dati na po naman natin pinanindigan.

asr-001424
02:01:54.380 --> 02:01:56.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So balit ngayon mas matibay po yung pinangahawakan natin.

asr-001425
02:01:57.000 --> 02:02:02.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ng mga regional wage boards, pinangahawakan nila na dapat talagang ipatupad.

asr-001426
02:02:03.000 --> 02:02:06.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At yan po ang abangan at babantayan po ng ating mga manggagawa.

asr-001427
02:02:06.880 --> 02:02:15.060
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kamakailan lamang po, nakailang beses akong bumalik doon sa picket line ng DUWU, yung DHL United Workers Union, na nandyan po sa sukat.

asr-001428
02:02:15.460 --> 02:02:21.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At sumulat din po ako sa inyong tanggapan at just yesterday natanggap ko po yung inyong tugon.

asr-001429
02:02:21.120 --> 02:02:26.980
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At gusto ko lang pong linawin kasi ang sinasabi ng DHL management ay nag-terminate daw po ng kontra,

asr-001430
02:02:27.000 --> 02:02:29.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: ng Robinsons Supermarket Corporation.

asr-001431
02:02:29.680 --> 02:02:37.120
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya bigla nilang isasarado yung kanila pong warehouse sa sukat dahil ito daw po ay wala ng reason para mag-open.

asr-001432
02:02:37.240 --> 02:02:39.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So ito po ay malinaw na union busting.

asr-001433
02:02:39.680 --> 02:02:50.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong ko po sa Dole, nakita nyo po ba yung termination na letter or agreement between DHL and Robinsons Supermarket Corporation?

asr-001434
02:02:51.240 --> 02:02:56.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nakatutok po tayo dyan yung ating pong NCMB at yung ilan po nating,

asr-001435
02:02:57.000 --> 02:02:58.040
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Assistant Secretaries.

asr-001436
02:02:58.240 --> 02:03:04.300
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: In fact, merong mga pangkasalukuyang pag-uusap at alam ko naman po, Your Honor, kayo nakatutok din.

asr-001437
02:03:04.680 --> 02:03:14.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Siguro ipagpaumanhinan na nahuli ng dating yung aking tugon dahil napakaraming mga holiday noong mga nakaraang araw dahil sa habagat.

asr-001438
02:03:14.980 --> 02:03:21.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pero kung makukuha niyo po ang detalye, nandito si Asec Kati sa akin.

asr-001439
02:03:22.240 --> 02:03:23.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi ko alam kung saan siya nakatayo.

asr-001440
02:03:24.380 --> 02:03:26.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Si Asek Kati, can you provide some details?

asr-001441
02:03:27.000 --> 02:03:45.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: As to depending DHL concern without sacrificing some quasi-subjudice materials that would impact the current conciliation.

asr-001442
02:03:46.260 --> 02:03:47.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Go ahead, Asek Kati.

asr-001443
02:03:50.000 --> 02:03:54.540
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: Mr. Chair, Your Honors, good afternoon po.

asr-001444
02:03:54.540 --> 02:04:11.480
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: To answer your question, with permission of the Secretary, ang nakita lang po namin ay yung service agreement na huli. Yun po yung nakita ng Department of Labor for the first five years.

asr-001445
02:04:11.840 --> 02:04:13.040
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: Ang NCMB po ang nakaka-

asr-001446
02:04:13.040 --> 02:04:17.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Can you repeat that, please? Medyo mahina po. If you can speak closer to the microphone. Thank you, Mr. Chair.

asr-001447
02:04:17.760 --> 02:04:22.760
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: Yes, sir. Through the NCMB, Your Honor, nakita po namin yung service agreement which…

asr-001448
02:04:24.540 --> 02:04:29.920
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: For the first five years. 2018 to 2025 po ang expiry niya.

asr-001449
02:04:30.200 --> 02:04:40.480
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Opo. Kasi po, kung matatanda po ng ating mga kababayan, ang mismo pong DHL, in-announce last year na na-extend for another three years yung kanila pong kontrata sa DHL.

asr-001450
02:04:40.580 --> 02:04:44.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakita po ba natin ito, yung pronouncement na ito, mismo ng DHL?

asr-001451
02:04:44.920 --> 02:04:46.000
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: Hindi po, Your Honor.

asr-001452
02:04:46.860 --> 02:04:52.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Marami po kasi nagtatanong, why is the DOLE giving credence to this union buster that is DHL?

asr-001453
02:04:53.060 --> 02:04:54.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po, yung isa po sa tanong.

asr-001454
02:04:54.540 --> 02:05:04.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kung natin sa DOLE, ay bakit hindi niyo po ginamit ang Article 292B ng Labor Code para pigilan ang mass termination na ating mga gagawa sa DHL po?

asr-001455
02:05:06.120 --> 02:05:16.740
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: Sir, kasi po, at this point po, nakasara na po ang DHL. Na-terminate na po yung service agreement and nagkaroon na po ng transition.

asr-001456
02:05:17.160 --> 02:05:24.100
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: So, we, on the part of the Department of Labor, it has become moot na po.

asr-001457
02:05:24.540 --> 02:05:37.680
DOLE OIC-Assistant Secretary Catherine L. Parado: To suspend any termination since the termination of the employee through redundancy, based on redundancy, took effect August 31 of this year.

asr-001458
02:05:39.060 --> 02:05:42.160
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nakababahala po, Mr. Chair, na isa itong malinaw na union busting.

asr-001459
02:05:42.320 --> 02:05:48.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya po, marami nagtatanong, ano ang mekanismo natin para magpigilan na ganitong labor rights violation sa ating bansa?

asr-001460
02:05:49.000 --> 02:05:53.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para pong ganun-ganun na lang, kadali para sa isang malaking kumpanya tulad ng DHL.

asr-001461
02:05:53.380 --> 02:05:54.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Natapakan ang karapatanan.

asr-001462
02:05:54.540 --> 02:05:57.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: But let me move on to another issue.

asr-001463
02:05:58.160 --> 02:06:00.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Puta naman po tayo sa issue ng NEA.

asr-001464
02:06:00.740 --> 02:06:06.360
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: We appreciate DOLE for establishing the Electric Cooperative Industry Tripartite Council.

asr-001465
02:06:06.800 --> 02:06:08.960
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Dahil matagal na itong demand ng labor movement.

asr-001466
02:06:09.420 --> 02:06:19.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ngunit concerned pa rin po tayo, dahil hanggang sa ngayon, NEA merely suspended rather than rescinded the policies that allow it to interfere in collective bargaining.

asr-001467
02:06:20.280 --> 02:06:23.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Can we get the commitment of the good secretary to issue a joint issuance?

asr-001468
02:06:23.540 --> 02:06:32.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Upholding workers' rights to organize, bargain collectively, and strike even before the ECITC is fully operational?

asr-001469
02:06:36.760 --> 02:06:39.800
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: May kinakausap kasi.

asr-001470
02:06:39.800 --> 02:06:41.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ako ni Congressman Vergara,

asr-001471
02:06:41.320 --> 02:06:42.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: But I can respond. I can respond.

asr-001472
02:06:42.660 --> 02:06:43.240
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Okay, go ahead.

asr-001473
02:06:43.600 --> 02:06:52.660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Alam niyo po, Your Honor, for the first time, we sought the complete attendance of National Electrification Administration,

asr-001474
02:06:52.860 --> 02:06:57.600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na si Administrator Nani Almeda, not just because of this pending concern,

asr-001475
02:06:58.020 --> 02:07:02.120
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: but because we are aware that we were flagged by the International Labor Organization likewise.

asr-001476
02:07:02.120 --> 02:07:14.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The administration of NEA is now actively pursuing a tripartite system likewise within the sector.

asr-001477
02:07:14.680 --> 02:07:18.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: We understood, we took note of their concerns.

asr-001478
02:07:18.360 --> 02:07:26.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang sinasabi po nila, meron daw po mga ilang electric cooperatives na talagang malaki ang kinikita.

asr-001479
02:07:26.020 --> 02:07:27.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Meron naman na...

asr-001480
02:07:28.020 --> 02:07:28.600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Maliliit.

asr-001481
02:07:28.780 --> 02:07:38.280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Meron namang electric cooperatives na yung management took advantage pretending themselves to be part of the employees group

asr-001482
02:07:38.280 --> 02:07:41.120
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na nakikinabang din pag merong dinidistribute.

asr-001483
02:07:41.240 --> 02:07:47.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, meron po nga yung ongoing technical working group between DOLE and NEA para maresolba po ito.

asr-001484
02:07:47.820 --> 02:07:56.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Meron lang kaunting usapin na ayaw ibigay ng NEA yung kanilang quote-unquote regulatory...

asr-001485
02:07:58.020 --> 02:08:05.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: powers kung functions na madidilute kung sakaling pumasok sila sa ganitong kasunduan.

asr-001486
02:08:05.780 --> 02:08:11.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, yung ganun pong aspeto ay ang aming pinag-uusapan ngayon.

asr-001487
02:08:11.460 --> 02:08:17.100
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: It will take some time, but I think we're on the right path na mariresolba po ito.

asr-001488
02:08:17.180 --> 02:08:22.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: May commitment po si NEA Administrator Almeda patungkol po dito.

asr-001489
02:08:22.900 --> 02:08:26.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Mr. Chair, Mr. Secretary, gusto ko lang pong balaan kayo.

asr-001490
02:08:26.500 --> 02:08:27.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito pong si Director

asr-001491
02:08:28.020 --> 02:08:30.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Almeda, isang taon pa pong nangako sa amin dito sa Kongreso.

asr-001492
02:08:31.140 --> 02:08:35.580
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pero hanggang ngayon po, hindi pa rin sinususpindi itong policy that allows the NEA to interfere

asr-001493
02:08:35.580 --> 02:08:38.740
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: in the CBA of our workers' unions in this cooperative.

asr-001494
02:08:39.000 --> 02:08:42.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So, ang pakiusap po namin, while waiting for the tripartite policy,

asr-001495
02:08:42.300 --> 02:08:45.540
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: baka pwede po magbigay ng issuean sa DOLE para sa ganun po.

asr-001496
02:08:45.600 --> 02:08:51.680
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Pigilan po ito pong hindi po legal na prosesong ito ng pagharang sa CBA ng ating mga frontliners

asr-001497
02:08:51.680 --> 02:08:53.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pwede ting sa electric co-op industry.

asr-001498
02:08:54.260 --> 02:08:57.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you, Mr. Chair. I'd like to proceed to...

asr-001499
02:08:58.020 --> 02:09:02.300
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: September 29 po yung susunod na pagpupulong namin ng NEA.

asr-001500
02:09:02.740 --> 02:09:06.620
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: September 29, sana po, even before that, baka pwede na po may issueans

asr-001501
02:09:06.620 --> 02:09:11.900
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to the effect na sinuspinde po natin at nirescind yung current policy.

asr-001502
02:09:11.900 --> 02:09:17.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kasi po, kung mag-on-going pa po yung ating negotiations and dialogues,

asr-001503
02:09:17.800 --> 02:09:21.760
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: it will take time bago po fully ma-rescind itong polisiyang ito.

asr-001504
02:09:21.840 --> 02:09:26.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sana po, for the here and now, baka po pwedeng mahilingan ng isang issuance ang DOLE,

asr-001505
02:09:26.660 --> 02:09:32.700
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: to allow our unions to proceed with their CBA without the interference of the NEA administration.

asr-001506
02:09:33.140 --> 02:09:34.800
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pwede po akong makiusap, Your Honor.

asr-001507
02:09:35.620 --> 02:09:39.620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Pwede po kaya sa September 29 ay magpadala kayo ng isang kinatawan

asr-001508
02:09:39.620 --> 02:09:44.860
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: para makaharap din at maging bahagi ng usapin between DOLE and NEA?

asr-001509
02:09:45.540 --> 02:09:51.180
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang Power Centro po ay ipapadala natin sa natural dialogue na yan

asr-001510
02:09:51.180 --> 02:09:55.720
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po talaga marinig po ninyo ng diretsyo yung concerns sa ating workers in the power industry.

asr-001511
02:09:55.860 --> 02:09:56.300
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Salamat po.

asr-001512
02:09:56.300 --> 02:10:02.240
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me go to our colleague from the TESDA, Secretary Benitez.

asr-001513
02:10:02.520 --> 02:10:05.520
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sinabi po ng DTI noong nakaraang budget hearing po nila

asr-001514
02:10:05.520 --> 02:10:10.880
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: that they are shifting their industrial policy from automotive towards electric vehicles.

asr-001515
02:10:11.080 --> 02:10:14.340
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang tanong po ng Philippine Metal Workers Alliance ay

asr-001516
02:10:14.340 --> 02:10:18.820
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: may we ask if TESDA has ongoing plans to design TVET programs

asr-001517
02:10:18.820 --> 02:10:21.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: catered towards the electric vehicle industry?

asr-001518
02:10:21.900 --> 02:10:25.900
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: We, Mr. Chair, we already have competency

asr-001519
02:10:26.300 --> 02:10:31.380
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: standards and training regulations for EV, for electric vehicles po.

asr-001520
02:10:31.540 --> 02:10:36.820
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Ongoing po ang rollout ng training for EV in the energy sector.

asr-001521
02:10:36.820 --> 02:10:43.820
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: I can submit to your officer the list of all the electric vehicle trainings

asr-001522
02:10:43.820 --> 02:10:51.000
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: that actually TESDA already has, including for two-wheel, three-wheel,

asr-001523
02:10:51.260 --> 02:10:53.960
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: hanggang four-wheel po at trucks and buses.

asr-001524
02:10:54.260 --> 02:10:56.280
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Meron pong training regulations ang TESDA.

asr-001525
02:10:56.300 --> 02:10:59.640
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Some of these were developed in partnerships po

asr-001526
02:10:59.640 --> 02:11:05.240
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: with foreign companies, particularly from China

asr-001527
02:11:05.240 --> 02:11:08.200
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: that is in advance in terms of having training modules.

asr-001528
02:11:08.720 --> 02:11:12.220
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So meron po to answer very succinctly.

asr-001529
02:11:12.300 --> 02:11:14.860
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: At ibigay nyo na rin po sa amin kung saan pong areas

asr-001530
02:11:14.860 --> 02:11:17.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pwede maka-avail ng scholarship ang ating mga kababayan

asr-001531
02:11:17.920 --> 02:11:19.840
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: para po makapasok sa industriyang ito.

asr-001532
02:11:19.860 --> 02:11:20.240
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Yes po.

asr-001533
02:11:20.820 --> 02:11:22.400
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Maraming salamat po, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001534
02:11:22.820 --> 02:11:24.380
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Let me move on to my last point.

asr-001535
02:11:24.380 --> 02:11:26.280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Sana po umabot 15 seconds.

asr-001536
02:11:26.300 --> 02:11:29.020
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: May ipinabot pong concern ang mga kasama natin

asr-001537
02:11:29.020 --> 02:11:32.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: mula sa National Union of Building and Construction Workers

asr-001538
02:11:32.320 --> 02:11:33.780
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: at nagkaisa Labor Coalition.

asr-001539
02:11:34.200 --> 02:11:37.460
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Nabinbin daw po ang Construction Workers Training Program

asr-001540
02:11:37.460 --> 02:11:40.220
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nitong June 2026.

asr-001541
02:11:40.640 --> 02:11:45.260
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: The interruption of the 2026 cycle could deprive up to 300 workers

asr-001542
02:11:45.260 --> 02:11:47.920
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: of critical training opportunities.

asr-001543
02:11:48.840 --> 02:11:51.640
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ang mabilis pong tanong, bakit hindi natuloy ang training na ito

asr-001544
02:11:51.640 --> 02:11:56.080
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: and is DOLE considering the resumption of this very critical training program anytime soon?

asr-001545
02:11:56.080 --> 02:11:58.660
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: That would be my last question, Mr. Chair.

asr-001546
02:12:02.750 --> 02:12:04.350
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sorry, Mr. Chair.

asr-001547
02:12:04.470 --> 02:12:05.510
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sa amin pala yung tanong.

asr-001548
02:12:06.290 --> 02:12:12.090
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Sir, this is actually part of an agreement with the DPWH in Daga

asr-001549
02:12:12.090 --> 02:12:15.230
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: and the funds are still with DPWH po.

asr-001550
02:12:15.750 --> 02:12:19.470
