asr-001551
02:12:19.470 --> 02:12:24.130
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: for the displaced construction workers from DPWH projects.

asr-001552
02:12:24.770 --> 02:12:26.630
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So when do we plan to resum this program?

asr-001553
02:12:26.630 --> 02:12:29.390
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: We are waiting, sir, for the transfer of funds.

asr-001554
02:12:29.410 --> 02:12:31.510
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: We are waiting for the transfer of funds from the DPWH for this purpose.

asr-001555
02:12:31.970 --> 02:12:33.830
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: So we'll keep on following up, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001556
02:12:34.030 --> 02:12:34.430
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Thank you very much.

asr-001557
02:12:34.430 --> 02:12:35.230
