NCMB OIC-Executive Director IV Teresita E. Audea: Magandang hapon.

asr-001666
02:16:57.660 --> 02:17:09.280
NCMB OIC-Executive Director IV Teresita E. Audea: At with the permission of the Secretary, yung pong pondo ng voluntary arbitrators ay nakasama po at nakapaloob sa MOOE ng NCMB.

asr-001667
02:17:09.960 --> 02:17:21.980
NCMB OIC-Executive Director IV Teresita E. Audea: So yung pong sinasabi ni Honorable Speaker, Deputy Speaker Mendoza, ay isang malaking bagay kung madadagdagan po yung pondo na yun.

asr-001668
02:17:21.980 --> 02:17:32.020
NCMB OIC-Executive Director IV Teresita E. Audea: Ang training component po ng aming budget ay kinukuha para sa mga arbitrators po ay kinukuha sa CBA collection.

asr-001669
02:17:32.400 --> 02:17:41.140
NCMB OIC-Executive Director IV Teresita E. Audea: So doon po namin isinosource. Yun lamang po yung nakahiwalay. Siguro nga po maganda pagkadadagdagan yung aming budget para doon.

asr-001670
02:17:43.080 --> 02:17:43.700
NCMB OIC-Executive Director IV Teresita E. Audea: Salamat po.

asr-001671
02:17:44.160 --> 02:17:50.480
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Mr. Secretary. Dagdagan mo lang yung education na P355 per thousand per month.

asr-001672
02:17:50.480 --> 02:17:51.100
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Siguro naman.

asr-001673
02:17:51.500 --> 02:17:51.960
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And of course,

asr-001674
02:17:51.980 --> 02:17:55.620
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: thank you also for the, yung you already mentioned.

asr-001675
02:17:56.360 --> 02:18:03.800
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yung sunod naman, Mr. Secretary, amid all our debates regarding wage order number 27, let us be reminded, maraming gutom.

asr-001676
02:18:04.060 --> 02:18:10.880
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And of course, yung minimum wage, nandito naman si Executive Director MWPC. Maraming gutom.

asr-001677
02:18:11.200 --> 02:18:19.780
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And survival wages talaga. And already, I will not, you know, in support of kamanggagawa party list kong ELI.

asr-001678
02:18:20.680 --> 02:18:21.960
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ito lang, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001679
02:18:21.980 --> 02:18:35.500
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So, there is a, you know, you cited a Supreme Court that is already a, there is already a writ issue there.

asr-001680
02:18:35.920 --> 02:18:36.980
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: But in this case,

asr-001681
02:18:39.080 --> 02:18:42.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: so now we can talk to Joyce Manungsong, yung sa RTC.

asr-001682
02:18:44.520 --> 02:18:51.760
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: We could have, you know, if all of this, may appeal from TUCP is that hanapin nating solusyon.

asr-001683
02:18:52.220 --> 02:18:54.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And solusyon should be fast.

asr-001684
02:18:54.160 --> 02:18:54.640
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Kasi,

asr-001685
02:18:54.640 --> 02:18:55.580
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: kasi,

asr-001686
02:18:55.860 --> 02:18:58.720
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: there is a OSG,

asr-001687
02:18:59.820 --> 02:19:01.300
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: and you filed this, right?

asr-001688
02:19:01.840 --> 02:19:02.380
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mag-MR ka.

asr-001689
02:19:02.820 --> 02:19:04.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And if I read it na lang, para matapos tayo.

asr-001690
02:19:04.680 --> 02:19:09.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The assailed order should not restrain respondents in implementing the wage order

asr-001691
02:19:09.160 --> 02:19:13.080
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: in absence of valid and duly issued writ of preliminary injunction.

asr-001692
02:19:13.640 --> 02:19:20.200
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Sabi lang dito, it bears stressing that the assailed order merely granted the application of a WPI.

asr-001693
02:19:20.200 --> 02:19:24.140
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: However, it did not bring the writ into existence.

asr-001694
02:19:24.640 --> 02:19:25.500
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Rule 58 po.

asr-001695
02:19:26.160 --> 02:19:27.840
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Section 4B,

asr-001696
02:19:28.220 --> 02:19:34.740
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Rules of Court provides the issuance of writ is expressly relies on the fulfillment of certain conditions.

asr-001697
02:19:34.920 --> 02:19:36.040
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So, conditions in ikwanon.

asr-001698
02:19:36.460 --> 02:19:39.500
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: There is a, if I may mistake, a suspensive condition.

asr-001699
02:19:40.220 --> 02:19:43.740
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Do not like to stand on, importante na magbayad siya ng bond.

asr-001700
02:19:44.240 --> 02:19:48.140
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So, there is certain condition which is the bond in this particular, in this moment.

asr-001701
02:19:48.140 --> 02:19:54.520
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: This means that the order granting the P.I. or preliminary injunction,

asr-001702
02:19:54.640 --> 02:19:58.360
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: does not, standing alone, operate as a writ itself.

asr-001703
02:19:58.800 --> 02:20:03.440
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: The injunctive relief becomes legally operational only upon the fulfillment of the condition,

asr-001704
02:20:04.020 --> 02:20:06.840
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: followed by the formal issuance of the corresponding writ.

asr-001705
02:20:07.340 --> 02:20:10.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Until these mandatory steps are fully satisfied,

asr-001706
02:20:10.560 --> 02:20:14.000
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: the assailed order produces no binding injunctive effect.

asr-001707
02:20:14.320 --> 02:20:17.480
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Pagtatalo tayo dito, Mr. Secretary, your thoughts because I'm losing time.

asr-001708
02:20:17.960 --> 02:20:20.720
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Kasi talaga, there's no writ to talk about.

asr-001709
02:20:21.400 --> 02:20:21.960
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mr. Secretary.

asr-001710
02:20:22.760 --> 02:20:24.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Mga po kayo, yung pong...

asr-001711
02:20:24.460 --> 02:20:26.260
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mr. Secretary, this is OSG.

asr-001712
02:20:26.540 --> 02:20:28.120
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: This is the opinion of the OSG.

asr-001713
02:20:29.720 --> 02:20:37.260
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Idadagdag ko po, yun pong nakalagay sa pleading ng OSG,

asr-001714
02:20:38.040 --> 02:20:41.820
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay meron din pong nanggaling sa DOLE.

asr-001715
02:20:42.520 --> 02:20:46.980
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yun po ay bago din raft, in raft, finalized, bago finile,

asr-001716
02:20:47.480 --> 02:20:52.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay nag-uusap po ang DOLE at kung ano yung mga dapat tamang ilaman dyan.

asr-001717
02:20:52.840 --> 02:20:56.340
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kaya maulanggalang na sa Office of the Solicitor General,

asr-001718
02:20:56.900 --> 02:21:01.840
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung pong sila po yung nag-finalize niya pero malaki rin po ang inputs ng DOLE.

asr-001719
02:21:02.360 --> 02:21:07.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So lahat po nang sinabi dyan ay sumang-ayon kami at sumang-ayon sila.

asr-001720
02:21:08.020 --> 02:21:13.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yan po ay joint, collaborative endeavor between our legal,

asr-001721
02:21:13.840 --> 02:21:20.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: nandun pa po si Yusek Mosquera noon, na ngayon ay lumipat na sa kataas-taasang hukuman.

asr-001722
02:21:20.180 --> 02:21:22.180
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So yan po ay aming final...

asr-001723
02:21:22.180 --> 02:21:22.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Two.

asr-001724
02:21:22.840 --> 02:21:30.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Precisely pressure, compel, hindi ko po kilala yung nabanggit niyong kilala ko lang sa pangalan,

asr-001725
02:21:30.700 --> 02:21:39.000
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung judge, to pressure the judge to come up, come out with that appropriate resolution,

asr-001726
02:21:39.480 --> 02:21:50.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: dissolving any existing injunction, and proceed with the eventual implementation of Wage Order No. 27.

asr-001727
02:21:51.720 --> 02:21:51.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Mindful.

asr-001728
02:21:51.920 --> 02:21:53.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Mindful, Your Honor.

asr-001729
02:21:53.660 --> 02:21:59.740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Mindful, Your Honor, of another case which we never cited in that motion,

asr-001730
02:22:00.000 --> 02:22:05.440
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: which is entitled Active Wood Products versus Intermediate Appellate Court.

asr-001731
02:22:05.440 --> 02:22:15.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: This was issued in 1990, so this is a long-standing jurisprudence, Your Honor,

asr-001732
02:22:16.380 --> 02:22:21.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: wherein the Supreme Court rejected the argument,

asr-001733
02:22:21.920 --> 02:22:28.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: that the injunction or any order could simply be disregarded because the bond has not yet been filed.

asr-001734
02:22:29.120 --> 02:22:36.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: It held that the order plainly intended the acts sought to be stopped must be stopped by the court.

asr-001735
02:22:37.140 --> 02:22:47.620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: It should not be a unilateral action on the part of, again, I reiterate, the parties' litigants.

asr-001736
02:22:47.620 --> 02:22:51.700
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kaya nga po, Your Honor, nagkatulungan po ang OSG.

asr-001737
02:22:51.920 --> 02:22:59.400
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At ang DOLE, kung paano balangkasin yung naturang pleading para mapabilis po.

asr-001738
02:22:59.480 --> 02:23:04.740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At ito pong huling finile, itong September 3 motion to resolve,

asr-001739
02:23:05.100 --> 02:23:09.760
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay magkausap din po ang DOLE at ang OSG kung ano yung tenor,

asr-001740
02:23:10.200 --> 02:23:17.580
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: kung ano yung nilalamanan dapat i-file para madaling ma-resolve ba na yung naturang usapin, Your Honor.

asr-001741
02:23:19.400 --> 02:23:20.760
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001742
02:23:20.760 --> 02:23:22.860
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: This morning, I thank you for your visit.

asr-001743
02:23:23.160 --> 02:23:28.040
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And then, moving forward na lang tayo, let's find ways na ma-resolve ito.

asr-001744
02:23:28.700 --> 02:23:34.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: And then, with an assurance from you that there's no such thing as NCR Wage Order No. 28?

asr-001745
02:23:36.550 --> 02:23:45.550
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Your Honor, kasama po sa trabaho ng mga wage boards, ang humanap din siguro ng paraan.

asr-001746
02:23:46.050 --> 02:23:50.910
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit ang sinisigurado ko pong risulta dito, kung anuman ang mangyayari,

asr-001747
02:23:50.910 --> 02:23:53.550
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay yung hinihiling.

asr-001748
02:23:54.670 --> 02:24:02.930
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang ating mga manggagawa na tamang dagdag o mento, ay kanilang matatanggap ngayong taong ito.

asr-001749
02:24:03.090 --> 02:24:05.690
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi ko masabi kung anong buwan ngayong taon ito.

asr-001750
02:24:05.790 --> 02:24:07.970
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Lalong-lalo na po yung first tranche.

asr-001751
02:24:08.290 --> 02:24:12.230
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Dapat po matanggap na yan sa lalong madaling panahon.

asr-001752
02:24:12.870 --> 02:24:18.210
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang kinakabahan ko po, Your Honor, kanina, nabanggit ko sa inyo,

asr-001753
02:24:18.210 --> 02:24:24.650
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: meron na namang po ang Court of Appeals na ifinile dito po ng Isantiga.

asr-001754
02:24:24.670 --> 02:24:26.850
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Sa naman po ata ito.

asr-001755
02:24:26.990 --> 02:24:27.950
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001756
02:24:28.330 --> 02:24:29.670
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So dumadami po yung kaso.

asr-001757
02:24:29.690 --> 02:24:30.130
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: May may may excuse.

asr-001758
02:24:31.090 --> 02:24:33.450
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: This is very, it's complicating the issue.

asr-001759
02:24:33.570 --> 02:24:33.910
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes, sir.

asr-001760
02:24:34.010 --> 02:24:38.210
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Now, if you issue a Wage Order No. 28 na hindi pa yung tapos 27,

asr-001761
02:24:39.070 --> 02:24:43.730
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: you know, ako I'll be inclined, I'll join Mr. Eli here to defer.

asr-001762
02:24:44.450 --> 02:24:48.810
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Talo naman kami, pero let's, as I said, let's move forward.

asr-001763
02:24:49.090 --> 02:24:53.710
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Let's talk on how are we going to find ways, finding that solution, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001764
02:24:53.710 --> 02:24:54.490
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: But issuing?

asr-001765
02:24:54.670 --> 02:24:57.190
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Now, the Wage Order No. 28 is a complete no-no.

asr-001766
02:24:57.830 --> 02:24:58.770
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Hindi pwede, Mr. Secretary.

asr-001767
02:25:01.840 --> 02:25:02.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Makakatugon pa ako.

asr-001768
02:25:03.640 --> 02:25:04.660
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes, Sir Francis.

asr-001769
02:25:05.020 --> 02:25:06.900
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Apologies, Mr. Secretary. Please respond.

asr-001770
02:25:06.900 --> 02:25:11.940
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yung, yung, yung pong katapusan ng 27, yung kahihinatnan,

asr-001771
02:25:13.380 --> 02:25:15.340
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: inaamin ko po, wala po sa aking kamay.

asr-001772
02:25:16.180 --> 02:25:17.580
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Wala po sa aming kamay.

asr-001773
02:25:18.260 --> 02:25:22.160
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Dahil hindi natin alam kung ano mangyayari doon sa Supreme Court decision din.

asr-001774
02:25:22.920 --> 02:25:26.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Hindi po natin alam din, hindi, uulitin ko, hindi ko naman kilala yung,

asr-001775
02:25:26.620 --> 02:25:28.560
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ah, RTC Judge.

asr-001776
02:25:28.680 --> 02:25:31.600
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nung nag-file po ako, hindi ko alam kung nandun po siya.

asr-001777
02:25:31.760 --> 02:25:34.740
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Nung nag-file po ako ng motion for reconsideration,

asr-001778
02:25:35.000 --> 02:25:38.660
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: at wala naman po siguro akong karapatan, nakausapin ng juez.

asr-001779
02:25:39.400 --> 02:25:44.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, your Honor, ginagawa po natin lahat ang pamamaraan

asr-001780
02:25:44.520 --> 02:25:50.280
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: para nang sa ganun ay maibigay sa mga manggagawang Pilipino dito sa Metro Manila

asr-001781
02:25:50.280 --> 02:25:56.540
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung nararapat sa kanilang umento na hindi lumalabag po sa batas.

asr-001782
02:25:56.620 --> 02:26:02.380
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: At, ah, uulitin ko, yung husgado ay hindi po natin kontrolado.

asr-001783
02:26:02.500 --> 02:26:05.380
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Kung ganun katagal yan, hindi ko po masagot.

asr-001784
02:26:05.840 --> 02:26:11.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit, yung nasa saklaw ng, ah, umiiral na Labor Code of the Philippines,

asr-001785
02:26:12.400 --> 02:26:19.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: eh, hindi po, hindi po siguro dapat, ah, sabihin natin ngayon na hindi dapat gumalaw

asr-001786
02:26:19.240 --> 02:26:24.020
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: yung ating mga wage boards at gumagalaw naman po sila patungkol po dito.

asr-001787
02:26:24.020 --> 02:26:26.520
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: And, and likewise, ah, your Honor, siguro,

asr-001788
02:26:26.620 --> 02:26:32.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: maunawaan natin that there should be a stop on the filing of these TROs.

asr-001789
02:26:33.500 --> 02:26:38.920
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: They should be a halt, not a pause, ah, not through a court order,

asr-001790
02:26:39.080 --> 02:26:46.960
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: but the court should realize na bali talaga yun, na hindi dapat nila pigilin sa, yung, yung saklawan.

asr-001791
02:26:47.460 --> 02:26:52.620
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ah, isang beses lang po nangyari yan sa, sa bayan po ng ating kaibigan din,

asr-001792
02:26:52.620 --> 02:26:55.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: na yung mauna, si Senator Boy Herrera sa Bohol,

asr-001793
02:26:55.420 --> 02:26:58.900
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: nung meron nag-file po ng TRO sa Bohol nung araw.

asr-001794
02:26:59.440 --> 02:27:04.460
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Subalit, hindi naman po ito inaksyonan hanggang, hanggang mag-lapse na, your Honor.

asr-001795
02:27:05.300 --> 02:27:10.020
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Mr. Secretary. But, Mr. Chair, may I ask a humbling request?

asr-001796
02:27:10.120 --> 02:27:10.320
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Yes.

asr-001797
02:27:10.500 --> 02:27:12.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I think the NCR director is here.

asr-001798
02:27:13.160 --> 02:27:15.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: May we hear from him?

asr-001799
02:27:16.280 --> 02:27:18.720
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Yes. Go ahead. Is he around?

asr-001800
02:27:22.600 --> 02:27:25.280
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Please proceed with the, ah, lumapit po sa mic.

asr-001801
02:27:25.280 --> 02:27:30.660
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Ah, please wind up, ah, DS.

asr-001802
02:27:30.660 --> 02:27:31.660
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Pagbigyan na kita, Sir.

asr-001803
02:27:31.660 --> 02:27:32.160
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Okay?

asr-001804
02:27:32.160 --> 02:27:33.160
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Thank you, Chair.

asr-001805
02:27:33.160 --> 02:27:33.660
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Fire, fire.

asr-001806
02:27:33.660 --> 02:27:41.660
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Di, meron bang wage number 28 na ilalabas? Ah, yes or no?

asr-001807
02:27:41.660 --> 02:27:57.020
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: Your Honor, ah, your Honor, with the permission of, ah, Secretary, ah, the wage board NCR last night has issued already, ah, wage order number 28.

asr-001808
02:27:57.020 --> 02:28:03.620
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Magkano?

asr-001809
02:28:03.620 --> 02:28:09.100
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: It's, ah, an increase of, ah, 60 pesos.

asr-001810
02:28:09.100 --> 02:28:09.600
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: ...

asr-001811
02:28:09.600 --> 02:28:10.780
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: Ah, on top of, ah…

asr-001812
02:28:10.780 --> 02:28:12.720
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: From 85 to 50?

asr-001813
02:28:12.720 --> 02:28:13.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: 60.

asr-001814
02:28:13.600 --> 02:28:14.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: O nga, magkano, 60?

asr-001815
02:28:14.600 --> 02:28:15.600
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: 60.

asr-001816
02:28:15.600 --> 02:28:21.600
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: So, it's, it's 755 already, ah, Mr. Chair, the, ah, decision of the…

asr-001817
02:28:21.600 --> 02:28:29.360
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: So, what's the effect of wage 27? What's the effect of wage order number 27, please?

asr-001818
02:28:29.360 --> 02:28:44.230
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: Wage order number 27, ah, Mr. Chair, is, ah, is with the court. And, ah, we believe in the wage board that, ah, it has not attained its…

asr-001819
02:28:44.230 --> 02:28:47.230
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: It's, ah, full effectivity, Your Honor.

asr-001820
02:28:47.230 --> 02:28:56.590
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Can we…

asr-001821
02:28:56.590 --> 02:28:57.590
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Please, one of the…

asr-001822
02:28:57.590 --> 02:28:58.590
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Mr. Chair, ah, please.

asr-001823
02:28:58.590 --> 02:28:59.590
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Please, one of the…

asr-001824
02:28:59.590 --> 02:29:12.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: This is very important. Well, what is your basis for coming up with… hindi pa tapos yung 27, may 28 pa, binabakan nyo yung wage, ah, yung minimum wage na increase from, from…

asr-001825
02:29:12.990 --> 02:29:13.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: From 85 to 60?

asr-001826
02:29:13.990 --> 02:29:16.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: From 85 to 60 pesos na lang. Ano ba yan?

asr-001827
02:29:16.990 --> 02:29:17.990
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: If I may add, ah…

asr-001828
02:29:17.990 --> 02:29:19.990
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: I'd like to recognize, ah, Secretary Francis.

asr-001829
02:29:19.990 --> 02:29:20.990
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Yes, so…

asr-001830
02:29:20.990 --> 02:29:21.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: A difference to you, Mr. Secretary, but siya ang…

asr-001831
02:29:21.990 --> 02:29:22.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Ah…

asr-001832
02:29:22.990 --> 02:29:24.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Siya ang ano eh, sa NCR.

asr-001833
02:29:24.990 --> 02:29:25.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Opo.

asr-001834
02:29:25.990 --> 02:29:28.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: I think we, we, we should hear from… and then probably later on.

asr-001835
02:29:28.990 --> 02:29:31.990
Deputy Speaker Raymond Democrito C. Mendoza: Time to respond, ah, NCR Director, please.

asr-001836
02:29:31.990 --> 02:29:46.000
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: Yeah, thank you, Mr. Chair. The decision of the wage board in coming up with the 60-peso increase is, we believe, the best way

asr-001837
02:29:46.000 --> 02:29:50.000
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: that we can deliver immediately

asr-001838
02:29:50.000 --> 02:29:53.400
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: what has been waited for by the workers,

asr-001839
02:29:53.400 --> 02:29:57.000
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: which is the first tranche

asr-001840
02:29:57.000 --> 02:29:59.100
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: of Wage Order

asr-001841
02:29:59.100 --> 02:30:01.900
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: No. 27.

asr-001842
02:30:01.900 --> 02:30:04.180
DOLE NCR Regional Director Atty. Roy L. Buenafe: So, first of all, let me state, ah, please

asr-001843
02:30:04.180 --> 02:30:05.340
Rep. Rommel Rico T. Angara: Go ahead, Secretary Francis.

asr-001844
02:30:05.680 --> 02:30:13.480
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So ang ginawa ng, pasensya na, siguro, Your Honor, Bisaya din ito, kaya hindi diretso-diretso yung Tagalog.

asr-001845
02:30:14.080 --> 02:30:20.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Ang ginawa ng wage board ay ibigay yung first tranche.

asr-001846
02:30:20.800 --> 02:30:23.300
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The first tranche is not 85 pesos.

asr-001847
02:30:23.980 --> 02:30:26.220
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The first tranche is 60 pesos.

asr-001848
02:30:27.220 --> 02:30:28.420
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Tama po siguro yun?

asr-001849
02:30:28.880 --> 02:30:29.640
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: 60 pesos.

asr-001850
02:30:29.640 --> 02:30:34.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, yung ibibigay, kung sakaling approved na yung kanila, ay 60 pesos.

asr-001851
02:30:35.740 --> 02:30:38.720
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, yung for this year, tama po yun, di ba?

asr-001852
02:30:39.040 --> 02:30:43.240
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, for this year, hindi naman po ibibigay for this year ang 85 pesos.

asr-001853
02:30:43.820 --> 02:30:45.880
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: We're talking of 60.

asr-001854
02:30:46.620 --> 02:30:47.140
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: 60.

asr-001855
02:30:47.420 --> 02:30:49.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: Yun yung nilalaman ng 27.

asr-001856
02:30:50.720 --> 02:30:54.780
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, ang siguro nababalot sa kaisipan ay nasaan yung 25.

asr-001857
02:30:54.780 --> 02:30:59.160
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: The 25 is for next year.

asr-001858
02:30:59.640 --> 02:31:11.500
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: So, ang tinatanong ko rin, sa kaisipan ko, pag inulit ba, yung nilalaman ng wage order 27, na nandun yung 60 at nandun yung 25,

asr-001859
02:31:11.920 --> 02:31:18.000
DOLE Secretary Francis N. Tolentino: ay inulit lang yung wage order 27 na na-injection, which is a mockery of everything.

