TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: 5.3, po.

asr-007862
08:10:37.220 --> 08:10:37.720
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Sorry?

asr-007863
08:10:37.720 --> 08:10:38.220
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Nadagdagan.

asr-007864
08:10:38.220 --> 08:10:39.060
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Oh, it's updated.

asr-007865
08:10:39.060 --> 08:10:42.600
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Opo, it's 5.3 billion with these items, po.

asr-007866
08:10:42.600 --> 08:10:51.080
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: So, essentially, po, they described it as yung mga na-restore po natin last year.

asr-007867
08:10:51.260 --> 08:10:54.020
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Essentially, it's these items, po.

asr-007868
08:10:55.080 --> 08:10:56.900
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Ito po iyong SP-STEP, [unclear].

asr-007869
08:10:58.660 --> 08:11:00.700
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: May dalawang dagdag po sa baba.

asr-007870
08:11:01.160 --> 08:11:03.480
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Yeah, actually, Sec, I was gonna ask about that.

asr-007871
08:11:04.140 --> 08:11:06.000
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Zero siya, totally, in the NEP.

asr-007872
08:11:06.000 --> 08:11:09.480
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Because it's a new proposal, no?

asr-007873
08:11:09.480 --> 08:11:13.880
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: To make sure, ma'am, that we have the aligned senior high school teachers

asr-007874
08:11:13.880 --> 08:11:14.480
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: for the effectiveness.

asr-007876
08:11:14.540 --> 08:11:17.840
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: for the effectivity of the rollout for grade 12 in this coming year.

asr-007877
08:11:18.980 --> 08:11:21.360
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Not this school year, but the following school year

asr-007878
08:11:21.360 --> 08:11:22.880
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: for the TEC Pro curriculum.

asr-007879
08:11:23.240 --> 08:11:28.160
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: This is designed to make sure that the teachers within DepEd

asr-007880
08:11:28.160 --> 08:11:30.080
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: or within senior high school in general

asr-007881
08:11:30.080 --> 08:11:34.800
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: have the appropriate NCs as well as the TVET learning

asr-007882
08:11:34.800 --> 08:11:38.180
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: so that they can, in fact, be appropriately assessed.

asr-007883
08:11:38.580 --> 08:11:44.300
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Because one of the major obstacles, ma'am, in the senior high school assessment

asr-007884
08:11:44.520 --> 08:11:48.980
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: has been, in fact, that there are insufficient DepEd

asr-007885
08:11:48.980 --> 08:11:52.900
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: or senior high school teachers with the appropriate training

asr-007886
08:11:52.900 --> 08:11:54.460
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: and certification from TESDA.

asr-007887
08:11:55.520 --> 08:11:57.460
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So this is meant to cure that, no?

asr-007888
08:11:57.980 --> 08:12:00.940
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: And the second, ma'am, is an extension, again,

asr-007889
08:12:00.940 --> 08:12:04.880
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: with regards to stunting primarily

asr-007890
08:12:04.880 --> 08:12:09.060
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: to include barangay health workers and nutrition scholars

asr-007891
08:12:09.060 --> 08:12:14.060
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: for the expansion of the early childhood care and development initiative.

asr-007892
08:12:14.060 --> 08:12:17.340
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: That was started in 2025 and 2026.

asr-007893
08:12:18.220 --> 08:12:22.700
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: So in those two cases, ma'am, it's meant to help respond, in fact,

asr-007894
08:12:22.760 --> 08:12:25.260
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: to the EDCOM findings and to the NAP plan.

asr-007895
08:12:25.380 --> 08:12:27.200
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: There was a question earlier.

asr-007896
08:12:28.120 --> 08:12:33.860
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: The request of 5.3 is really just to get us back to the GAA level

asr-007897
08:12:33.860 --> 08:12:36.740
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: that we had for 2026.

asr-007898
08:12:37.340 --> 08:12:40.800
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: Rather than have a shrinkage, if you like,

asr-007899
08:12:40.800 --> 08:12:43.220
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: of the number of learners that we would,

asr-007900
08:12:44.060 --> 08:12:46.880
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: be able to serve in accordance, again,

asr-007901
08:12:47.180 --> 08:12:49.560
TESDA Secretary Jose Francisco "Kiko" Benitez: with the initiatives we agreed to in the NAP plan.

asr-007902
08:12:50.800 --> 08:12:52.440
Rep. Mikaela Angela B. Suansing: Thank you very much, po, Sekiko.

